  async cancelSubscription(subscriptionId: string) { ... },
  async getSubscriptionStatus() { ... },
  async isApplePayAvailable() { ... },
  async createApplePayPayment(amount: number, description: string) { ... },
};
```

Each method should call the appropriate Supabase edge function. Implement all methods fully.

## 8. Create src/services/index.ts
```typescript
