The existing screens import things that don't exist yet. Fix all of these:

## 1. Update theme/colors.ts - Add missing color keys

The AppNavigator.tsx uses `colors.tabActive`, `colors.tabInactive`, `colors.tabBarBg`. Add these to the existing colors.ts file. Read the file first, then edit it to add:

```
tabActive: '#00D998',
tabInactive: '#64748B',
tabBarBg: '#0A1628',
```

## 2. Update theme/index.ts - Add missing exports

DashboardScreen imports `fontSizes` from '../theme'. Add this export. Read the existing index.ts first, then add:

```typescript
