# Supabase Integration Quick Reference

## How to Use the Updated Store

### Initialize App
```typescript
import { useStore } from '@/hooks/useStore';

function App() {
  useEffect(() => {
    useStore.getState().initialize();
  }, []);

  return <AppNavigator />;
}
```

### Bills - Real Supabase Data
```typescript
const { 
  bills,              // Live bills from database
  addBillAsync,       // Create new bill
  updateBillAsync,    // Update existing bill
  deleteBillAsync,    // Delete bill
  getBucket,          // Get bucket for bill
} = useStore();

// Add bill
const { error } = await addBillAsync({
  name: 'Rent',
  amount: 1200,
  dueDay: 1,
  category: 'housing',
  cadence: 'monthly',
});

// Update bill
await updateBillAsync(billId, { amount: 1250 });

// Delete bill
await deleteBillAsync(billId);
```

### Linked Accounts - Real Supabase Data
```typescript
const {
  linkedAccounts,         // Live accounts from database
  addLinkedAccountAsync,  // Link new account via Plaid
  removeLinkedAccountAsync,
  setPrimaryAccountAsync,
} = useStore();

// Add account
const { error } = await addLinkedAccountAsync({
  bankName: 'Chase',
  accountMask: '****1234',
  accountType: 'checking',
  institutionId: 'inst_123',
});
```

### Payments - Stripe Integration
```typescript
import { StripeService } from '@/services';

// Create payment intent for bill
const { data, error } = await StripeService.createPaymentIntent(
  500,      // amount
  billId,   // bill to pay
  pmId      // payment method ID
);

// Get saved payment methods
const { data: methods } = await StripeService.getPaymentMethods();

// Add new card
const { data: newCard } = await StripeService.addPaymentMethod(token);
```

### Bank Linking - Plaid Integration
```typescript
import { PlaidService } from '@/services';

// Start Plaid Link flow
const { data: linkToken } = await PlaidService.createLinkToken();

// After user completes Plaid Link
const { data: account } = await PlaidService.exchangeToken(
  publicToken,
  metadata
);

// Auto-detect bills from transactions
const { data: detectedBills } = await PlaidService.detectBills(accountId);
```

### Push Notifications
```typescript
import { PushNotificationService } from '@/services';

// Register on app launch
useEffect(() => {
  PushNotificationService.registerForPushNotifications();

  // Set up notification handlers
  const unsubscribe = PushNotificationService.setupNotificationListeners({
    onNotificationReceived: (notification) => {
      console.log('Received notification:', notification);
    },
    onNotificationResponseReceived: (response) => {
      const { type } = response.notification.request.content.data;
      if (type === 'bill_reminder') {
        // Navigate to bills screen
      }
    },
  });

  return unsubscribe;
}, []);

// Schedule bill reminder
await PushNotificationService.scheduleBillReminder(
  'Rent',
  new Date('2026-05-01'),
  1200
);
```

## Error Handling Pattern

All async actions return `{ error?: string }`:

```typescript
const { error } = await useStore.getState().addBillAsync(billData);

if (error) {
  showErrorToast(error);  // Handle error
} else {
  showSuccessToast('Bill added!');
}
```

## State Access Patterns

```typescript
// Get current state
const state = useStore.getState();
console.log(state.bills);

// Subscribe to changes
useStore.subscribe(
  (state) => state.bills,
  (bills) => {
    console.log('Bills updated:', bills);
  }
);

// Use in React component
function MyComponent() {
  const { bills, isLoading, dataError } = useStore();

  if (isLoading) return <LoadingScreen />;
  if (dataError) return <ErrorScreen error={dataError} />;

  return <BillsList bills={bills} />;
}
```

## Fallback Behavior

If Supabase is not configured or unavailable:
- App uses mock data as fallback
- Operations complete synchronously
- No error thrown - graceful degradation
- When Supabase comes online, data syncs automatically

```typescript
// This still works even without Supabase:
await useStore.getState().addBillAsync(billData);
// Falls back to: useStore.getState().addBill(billData)
```

## Database Service Methods

### BillService
```typescript
BillService.create(userId, billData)
BillService.get(billId)
BillService.list(userId)              // Active bills only
BillService.listAll(userId)           // All bills
BillService.update(billId, updates)
BillService.delete(billId)            // Soft delete (is_active = false)
```

### ContributionService
```typescript
ContributionService.create(data)
ContributionService.list(userId)
ContributionService.getByBill(billId)
ContributionService.getByBucket(bucketId)
ContributionService.update(id, updates)
```

### LinkedAccountService
```typescript
LinkedAccountService.create(userId, data)
LinkedAccountService.list(userId)
LinkedAccountService.getPrimary(userId)
LinkedAccountService.setPrimary(accountId, userId)
LinkedAccountService.delete(accountId)
```

### NotificationService
```typescript
NotificationService.list(userId)
NotificationService.getUnread(userId)
NotificationService.markAsRead(notificationId)
NotificationService.markAllAsRead(userId)
NotificationService.delete(notificationId)
```

### ProfileService
```typescript
ProfileService.get(userId)
ProfileService.update(userId, data)
ProfileService.create(userId, data)
```

## Environment Variables

Required in `.env.local`:
```
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
```

## Testing Checklist

- [ ] Auth flow works (sign up, sign in, sign out)
- [ ] Bills fetch from database on sign in
- [ ] Can create/update/delete bills
- [ ] Linked accounts sync with Plaid
- [ ] Payment methods save and retrieve
- [ ] Push notifications register and schedule
- [ ] Notifications appear at scheduled times
- [ ] Offline mode works with mock data
- [ ] Session persists across app restarts
- [ ] Auto token refresh works

