- Read /sessions/relaxed-busy-allen/fractional-app/src/services/auth.ts

## Tasks:

### 1. Update useStore.ts to use real Supabase data

The store currently falls back to mock data. Update ALL the async action implementations to actually call the database services. Read the full store file first to understand the current structure.

Key patterns to follow:
- Each action should call the appropriate service from database.ts
- On success, update the local state optimistically
